# ============================================================
# VAF domain ontology - T-Box (one file for the unit)
# Every class and property of the VAF domain ontology as ONE file (BP-D54). Each former ontology file is a module: a block that starts at its marker line, carries a resource at the former header IRI with the old header's statements (less its type), and says dcterms:isPartOf on every subject. Terms keep their IRIs. A pure union of the former files, proved.
# Built by 03-tooling/vaf_domain_merge_v1_0_11.py; the proofs are in 04-documentation/domain_merge_report_v1_0_11.json.
# ============================================================

